    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_data_heading">Data used</string>
    <string name="privacy_data_text">Tasks, saved places, selected coordinates, and settings are stored locally on your device. An encrypted backup is created only when you request it and is written to the file you select. Voice input is handled by the selected system speech service. The app has no proprietary server.</string>
    <string name="privacy_location_heading">Location</string>
    <string name="privacy_location_text">With your permission, the app uses precise location, including in the background when the app is closed or not in use. Android needs this to detect entry into a task location and show a reminder. Location history is not recorded.</string>
    <string name="privacy_control_heading">Data control</string>
    <string name="privacy_control_text">Location reminders can be disabled for each task and permissions can be revoked in system settings. Access to the app can be protected with the Android screen lock. Automatic cloud backup is disabled; data is transferred with a password-encrypted file.</string>
    <string name="privacy_maps_heading">Maps</string>
    <string name="privacy_maps_text">When an API key is configured, the location picker uses Yandex MapKit SDK, which is governed by Yandex privacy policy.</string>
    <string name="privacy_updated">Updated August 5, 2026</string>

